  function renderMonthlyCards(){const selected=dashboardMetrics(monthTransactionsFor(dashboardMonth)),previous=dashboardMetrics(monthTransactionsFor(shiftMonth(dashboardMonth,-1)));const cards=[['income',selected.income,previous.income,'income-tone'],['expense',selected.expense,previous.expense,'expense-tone'],['investment',selected.investment,previous.investment,'investment-tone'],['savings',selected.savings,previous.savings,selected.savings<0?'expense-tone':'income-tone']];$('#monthlyCards').innerHTML=cards.map(([key,value,prior,tone])=>metricCard(T[key],value,prior,tone)).join('')}
  function renderCategoryChart(list){const totals=new Map();list.filter(x=>x.type==='Daily Expense').forEach(x=>{const key=x.category||'Other';totals.set(key,(totals.get(key)||0)+(Number(x.amount)||0))});const rows=[...totals.entries()].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]);const total=rows.reduce((s,x)=>s+x[1],0);const empty=$('#categoryEmpty'),holder=$('#categoryDonut'),legend=$('#categoryLegend');empty.hidden=total>0;holder.innerHTML='';legend.innerHTML='';if(!total)return;const colors=['#df665c','#e6a343','#5b8bd9','#4eaa7a','#9a70c5','#2c9da0','#d18454','#758c9b','#b983a4','#89934b'];const circumference=2*Math.PI*34;let offset=0;const circles=rows.map(([,amount],i)=>{const length=amount/total*circumference;const circle=`<circle cx="50" cy="50" r="34" fill="none" stroke="${colors[i%colors.length]}" stroke-width="13" stroke-dasharray="${length} ${circumference-length}" stroke-dashoffset="${-offset}"/>`;offset+=length;return circle}).join('');holder.innerHTML=`<svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-label="${esc(T.expenseByCategory)}"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="34" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="13"/>${circles}<text x="50" y="48" text-anchor="middle" class="donut-total">${esc(rupees(total))}</text><text x="50" y="59" text-anchor="middle" class="donut-caption">${esc(T.expense)}</text></svg>`;legend.innerHTML=rows.map(([name,amount],i)=>`<div class="category-legend-row"><i style="background:${colors[i%colors.length]}"></i><span>${esc(categoryLabel(name))}</span><strong>${rupees(amount)}</strong></div>`).join('')}
  function renderSixMonthChart(){const keys=Array.from({length:6},(_,i)=>shiftMonth(dashboardMonth,i-5));const data=keys.map(key=>({key,values:dashboardMetrics(monthTransactionsFor(key))}));const max=Math.max(1,...data.flatMap(x=>[x.values.income,x.values.expense]));const base=135,scale=104/max,svg=data.map((item,i)=>{const x=31+i*57,amounts=[item.values.income,item.values.expense],colors=['#16875d','#dc5a55'];const bars=amounts.map((v,j)=>`<rect x="${x+j*14}" y="${base-v*scale}" width="10" height="${Math.max(0,v*scale)}" rx="3" fill="${colors[j]}"/>`).join('');const [y,m]=item.key.split('-').map(Number);const label=new Date(y,m-1,1).toLocaleDateString('en-IN',{month:'short'});return `${bars}<text x="${x+12}" y="154" text-anchor="middle">${label}</text>`}).join('');const any=data.some(x=>x.values.income||x.values.expense);$('#sixMonthEmpty').hidden=any;$('#sixMonthChart').innerHTML=any?`<svg viewBox="0 0 360 166" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="${esc(T.incomeVsExpense)}"><path d="M20 135H350" stroke="var(--line)"/>${svg}</svg>`:''}
